# Allow only project metadata, Python source, and synthetic test code.
# All other files and directories, including data, outputs, archives,
# environments, and caches, are ignored regardless of their filenames.
*
!/.gitignore
!/.python-version
!/pyproject.toml
!/uv.lock
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/src/
!/src/mitchell_sfs/
!/src/mitchell_sfs/*.py
!/tests/
!/tests/*.py
